# Short links for the campaign. Keep these stable; they are printed on things.
# Cloudflare Pages serves pages extensionless and 308s /x.html to /x, so every target here must be
# extensionless too. Pointing /museum at /museum.html made an infinite redirect loop on the live site.
# For the same reason there is no /museum, /count, /press, /brand, /agents or /counted rule: Pages
# already serves those names, and adding a rule would send them straight back into the loop.
/spin            /museum#room=random                          302
/atlas           /map                                         302
/read            /learn                                       302
/questions       /faq                                         302
/allowlist       /whitelist                                   302
/prints-shipping /shipping                                    302
